ins:\n\n**Header Tests (8 tests):**\n- Header displays app title\n- Header shows count of incomplete todos when some are active\n- Header shows zero count when all todos are completed\n- Header shows correct count with singular item\n- Header count updates when a todo is toggled complete\n- Header count updates when a todo is toggled back to active\n- Header count updates when a new todo is added\n- Header count updates when a todo is deleted\n\n**AddTodo Tests (8 tests):**\n- Add todo input displays placeholder text\n- Create a new todo by pressing Enter\n- Pressing Enter with empty input does not create a todo\n- Pressing Enter with whitespace-only input does not create a todo\n- Input clears after successfully creating a todo\n- New todo appears at the top of the list\n\n### 5. Test Specification Documentation\n\nLocated at `/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md` - Comprehensive test specification covering:\n- Header component behavior\n- AddTodo component functionality\n- TodoList item display and interactions\n- FilterBar filtering options\n- SortDropdown sorting functionality\n- EditTodoModal fields and actions\n\n### 6. Source Components\n\nThe application has these React components in `/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/`:\n- **Header.tsx** - Displays app title and incomplete item count\n- **AddTodo.tsx** - Input field for creating new todos\n- **TodoList.tsx** - Main list display\n- **TodoItem.tsx** - Individual todo item display\n- **FilterBar.tsx** - Filter buttons (All, Active, Completed)\n- **SortDropdown.tsx** - Sorting options\n- **EditTodoModal.tsx** - Modal for editing todo details\n\n### 7. Task File Information\n\nThe task file `/repo/tasks/tasks-app-building-gu9tow.json` shows the current work is focused on the `todo-app` with these pending tasks:\n- FixTests: tests/header-add-todo.spec.ts (ACTIVE)\n- FixTests: tests/sort-dropdown.spec.ts\n- FixTests: tests/todo-list.spec.ts\n- Deploy to production (future task)\n\n### 8. Test Setup and Fixtures\n\n*